abstract: >-
  SpecAudit measures whether an altered third-party draft model can influence
  the final answer of a speculative-decoding service when the target model,
  user requests, and decoding code are fixed, and only the server-selected
  verification rule is lossy.  The release contains the decoding harness,
  verifier implementations, training and evaluation scripts, judges, tests, and
  frozen aggregate evidence.
